The program below is meant to accept five numbers from the user and display the sum of the even numbers among them. There are syntax and logical errors in the code. Rewrite it after removing all the errors. Also, underline all the corrections made.<pre>total = 0
for i in range(5)
    n = int(input("Enter a number: ")
    if n % 2 = 0:
        total += i
print("Sum of even numbers:", total)</pre>

Predict the output of the following Python code:<pre>info = {"pen": 10, "book": 45,
        "bag": 350, "ink": 25}
total = 0
for item in info:
    if len(item) == 3:
        total += info[item]
    else:
        info[item] = info[item] * 2
print(total, info)</pre>

